    "detailed_description": "<strong>JAPP:</strong><i> Just Another Precise Platformer</i> is a mouse based 2D precision platformer that is quite challenging.<br>But when you have the physics of the game in your fingers, it's a pure bliss.<br><br>Climb to the top the fastest possible way is your mission on this game! <br>You can (for now) play 2 characters, the <strong>Square</strong> &amp; the <strong>Circle</strong>. <br>Both have their advantages and disadvantages, but you can climb to the top as fast with both. <br><br>I hope you will enjoy this as much as I enjoyed making this game. <br><br><strong>Have fun :)</strong>",
